# Flesh Burrower's attack trigger says "another target creature you control": attacking alone, with only Bot2's Ornithopter besides
# it, it has no legal target and never goes on the stack (CR 603.3d), so the Burrower alone hits for 2 and nothing gains deathtouch.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Flesh Burrower
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Flesh Burrower.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Flesh Burrower > Bot2)
? Stack.Count = 0
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Flesh Burrower.Keywords = Deathtouch
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = Flying
Bot2.Life = 18
